{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In This free demo of a Game About Cutting a Tree You Get Access to a small forest. The Game is simple, Cut down all the trees.....   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A minimalist game about restoring nature\u2019s balance in an overgrown demo forest With only your axe and determination, carve a path through dense vegetation, collect valuable wood, and uncover the secrets hidden beneath the roots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features   </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chop Down Trees</strong> \u2013 Clear the trees and shape the demo environment around you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather &amp; Sell Wood</strong> \u2013 Collect resources to trade for better tools and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Axe</strong> \u2013 Start with basic tools and work your way up through the first demo upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Stamina</strong> \u2013 Pace yourself to avoid overexertion and injury.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restore &amp; Reclaim</strong> \u2013 Transform the landscape in the demo map, bringing life back to forgotten places</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688830?t=1749480332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688830?t=1749480332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688830/64c2c7c4688a2d3ada9360ee93edfc1ca0625a94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749480332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688830/64c2c7c4688a2d3ada9360ee93edfc1ca0625a94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749480332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Th